  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in a large wok over high heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and stir-fry until fragrant.",
    "Add the thinly sliced beef brisket and stir-fry until browned.",
    "Add the gochujang and soy sauce and stir-fry for 1 minute.",
    "Add the beef stock and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Prepare the lettuce leaves and chopped green onions for ssam.",
    "Assemble the ssam by placing a few slices of the beef onto a lettuce leaf and topping with green onions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
